N:My father, Tom Paley, played a version of this tune with a less unusual second part, which also
N:has lyrics.
N:I learnt this version from banjo player Dan Stewart. The second part begins with a two-bar
N:phrase played three times. In this transcription I've written the phrase in three different
N:ways to suggest some of the possibilities for variation.
